  "description": "C# API client for interacting with the Gotenberg v7 & v8 micro-service's API, a docker-powered stateless API for converting & merging HTML, Markdown and Office documents to PDF, taking screenshots, and performing standalone PDF operations (flatten, rotate, split, encrypt). The client supports a configurable Polly retry policy with exponential back-off for handling transient exceptions.",
